錯的，餐點份量也很剛好，小孩也吃得開心。這次點了奶香風味的拉麵、明太子飯、日式涼拌豆腐跟溏心蛋，全部上桌的速度算快，對有小孩的家庭來說真的很加分。\n\n拉麵的湯頭濃郁但不會膩，麵條Q彈，叉燒厚度剛剛好，不會乾柴；玉米筍跟青花菜的搭配讓整碗更清爽。明太子飯很受小孩歡迎，醬料給得不手軟，拌一拌每一口都很入味。涼拌豆腐上面的柴魚跟醬汁很搭，夏天吃特別順口。溏心蛋也處理得不錯，蛋黃半熟滑順，味道有進去。\n\n店內環境乾淨明亮，桌面整潔，醬料盒、筷子區也都保持得很好。座位間距不會太擠，帶小朋友也不會覺得壓力很大。服務人員態度親切，幫忙加水、收空盤都很主動。\n\n整體來說，以這個價位跟食物品質來講，算是CP值不錯的一間店。偶爾想簡單吃一頓溫暖的日式拉麵，這裡會是會再回訪的店。適合家庭客、平日快速用餐、或想吃點不會踩雷的日式口味。",null,[0,95]]]],[null,1763900712000000,1763900712000000,"9 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfeTVwWHEtd2dGZDdlQjUyQlJ5QzBzdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfeTVwWHEtd2dGZDdlQjUyQlJ5QzBzdxoTQ2d3SXFQcUx5UVlRN2Jqbi1BSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiNq6GXy9KWAxU_UPUHHSN_HlQQ_2MIYygK"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7159767024858626990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBaZWxJd1ZYZGhSV1JDV2xWc1dXUXdOVzFUVlZWNVdsZGpNR0ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7159767024858626990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBaZWxJd1ZYZGhSV1JDV2xWc1dXUXdOVzFUVlZWNVdsZGpNR0ZZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7159767024858626990/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBaZWxJd1ZYZGhSV1JDV2xWc1dXUXdOVzFUVlZWNVdsZGpNR0ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7159767024858626990/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBaZWxJd1ZYZGhSV1JDV2xWc1dXUXdOVzFUVlZWNVdsZGpNR0ZZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7159767024858626990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBaZWxJd1ZYZGhSV1JDV2xWc1dXUXdOVzFUVlZWNVdsZGpNR0ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7159767024858626990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBaZWxJd1ZYZGhSV1JDV2xWc1dXUXdOVzFUVlZWNVdsZGpNR0ZZWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["非常感謝您的肯定，不管是大朋友小朋友，新朋友老朋友，希望讓所有好朋友都能安心愉快的用餐，期待您闔家再度光臨。",null,[0,54]]]],[null,null,3346,["https://ww